msgid "Could not get orphaned resolvers for @server_name as its registry class (@klass) does not implement getAllFieldResolvers."
msgstr "Impossibile ottenere i resolver orfani per @server_name perché la relativa classe di registro (@klass) non implementa getAllFieldResolvers."

